# Stray compiled output from running `SelfhostCLI run <path>`/`run selfhost` directly (via
# `java -cp ...`) without an explicit output path -- lands in the working directory otherwise.
# Root-anchored (leading `/`) so this never matches the real, checked-in bootstrap seed under
# selfhost/bootstrap/*.class or selfhost/bootstrap/hc/**/*.class.
/*.class
/hc/
/net/
/hs_err_pid*.log
